Z||000037||Oreif||08-18-2001||05:03 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Dave Gunsul:<BR><B><BR>2. Illinois construction!!! Can't they leave one friggin road alone for crying out loud??<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually Illinois use to have 4 seasons. (Spring, Summer, Fall and Winter) But due to the cost overruns and the politicians loosing money, they have raised the cost and amount of tolls, deleted Spring, Summer, and Fall and replaced it with only 1 season. So now Illinois only has 2 seasons:<BR>Winter and Construction!<P>Also, Construction season is very hard work and keeps many people employed. Each area has to have a boss, 2 workers, and a flag person. Not to mention they need a large truck that sleeps 4. <BR> Then once they set up the zones, they have many employees flying around watching traffic. So as soon as you find an alternate route they can add another zone and hire 4 more people. Remember it takes a skilled crew to make a road that only lasts 1 year.<P>For those members who do not live in Illinois, We have added the state flag to all major highways at the state line.<BR>An example is shown below:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/12_3.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000038||Pontiaddict||08-18-2001||05:26 PM||||People||||reg||1
